	)
	(text "Y100 provides a 25 MHz external clock through the 33 ohm R101 to\nMCU_HSE_CLK. Y101 is the 32.768 kHz LSE crystal, with 12 pF load capacitors\nC130 and C131. These two clock networks have different purposes and must be\nconfigured accordingly in firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 102.239 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "152cfb3a-2e72-42c2-b7e4-d8145e59ed86")
	)
	(text "Main MCU supply and core regulator | Rev.A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "15f54e91-7652-4345-9c3e-7456273a5848")
	)
	(text "Main MCU supply bypass capacitors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2813c7bd-52b3-4249-8503-fa56a8deee1f")
	)
	(text "U100 is the STM32H745 host processor. SYS3V3 supplies VDD, VDDLDO, VBAT and\nthe shown USB supply pins. R100 is a 0 ohm link feeding MCU_VDDA for VDDA\nand VREF+. The separate MCU units on the other sheets belong to this same\nphysical package."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "367c949c-bf17-44f2-a5c8-cdb6402f6986")
	)
	(text "The three VCAP pins share MCU_VCAP, with C119 and C120 providing two 2.2 uF\ncapacitors to ground. This net is the internal regulator reservoir, not an external\nsupply output. VDDSMPS, VFBSMPS and VSSSMPS are grounded; VLXSMPS is left\nopen in the drawn LDO supply configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 62.306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "523a6825-4204-45fd-a069-eb5f04a66a77")
	)
	(text "Backup and USB supply bypass"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
