	)
	(text "The 100 nF capacitors provide local bypass paths for the individual supply pins.\nThe 4.7 uF capacitors support the shared rail. The analog, backup and USB\nsupply groups have their own capacitors; their short return paths must be\npreserved during PCB placement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 82.273 0)
		(effects
